From e938ccc9f2637c16c504eff7821ad555cdb3463b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:04:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Gradle wrapper; dedupe and cache v2 portal ERP calls

- mobile: bump Gradle wrapper 9.1.0 -> 9.3.1 (Flutter requires >= 9.3.1)
- v2 portal: memoize identical ERP calls within a request and cache each
  section per user (?refresh=1 bypasses), so repeat requests skip the ERP
- v2 portal: copy the dashboard before merging saved items; it could be the
  shared cached object, leaking per-user data into the cache
- v2 portal: return 502 pointing to Settings when every section fails
  (usual cause is a changed ERP password) instead of 200 with all nulls
- v2 portal: return generic section errors instead of upstream error text
- rate-limit /api/v2 password routes (10/min)
- ignore *.patch; 13 new tests
